usage: isycode-ide tui [-h] COMMAND ...

ISyCode IDE — cliente de terminal con autoridad compartida

positional arguments:
  COMMAND
    provider  Manage providers
    secret    Manage API keys (secure)
    chat      Interactive chat (TUI)
    run       Run agent once with prompt
    policy    Show policy rules
    config    Show config paths

options:
  -h, --help  show this help message and exit
